.TH CUPIDTERMINAL 1 cupidterminal\-0.1
.SH NAME
cupidterminal \- st-compatible X11 terminal with Cupid extensions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cupidterminal
.RB [ \-aiv ]
.RB [ \-c
.IR class ]
.RB [ \-f
.IR font ]
.RB [ \-g
.IR geometry ]
.RB [ \-n
.IR name ]
.RB [ \-o
.IR iofile ]
.RB [ \-T
.IR title ]
.RB [ \-l
.IR line ]
.RB [ \-w
.IR windowid ]
.RB [[ \-e ]
.IR command
.RI [ arguments ...]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cupidterminal
is an X11 terminal emulator derived from st. It keeps st's command-line and
terminal behavior while adding scrollback, combining-mark storage, and a
separate X11-free parser module.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-a
Disable the alternate screen.
.TP
.BI \-c " class"
Set the window class (default: $TERM).
.TP
.BI \-f " font"
Set the fontconfig font description.
.TP
.BI \-g " geometry"
Set the character geometry and optional X11 position. The form is
[=][<cols>x<rows>][{+-}<xoffset>{+-}<yoffset>].
.TP
.B \-i
Fix the window to the size supplied by
.BR \-g .
.TP
.BI \-n " name"
Set the window instance name (default: $TERM).
.TP
.BI \-o " iofile"
Record terminal output in
.IR iofile .
The value "-" selects standard output.
.TP
.BI \-T " title"
Set the window title.
.TP
.BI \-t " title"
Alias for
.BR \-T .
.TP
.BI \-w " windowid"
Embed cupidterminal in the given X11 window.
.TP
.BI \-l " line"
Use a serial or pseudo-serial line instead of a new PTY. Remaining arguments
are passed to
.BR stty (1).
.TP
.B \-v
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-e " command " [ " arguments " "... ]"
Run a command instead of the shell. This must be the last option.
.SH SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl-Shift-c
Copy the primary selection to the clipboard.
.TP
.B Ctrl-Shift-v
Paste the clipboard.
.TP
.B Shift-Insert, Ctrl-Shift-y, middle click
Paste the primary selection.
.TP
.B Ctrl-Shift-Page Up / Page Down
Increase or decrease font size.
.TP
.B Ctrl-Shift-Home
Reset the font size.
.TP
.B Ctrl-Print Screen
Toggle printer output.
.TP
.B Shift-Print Screen
Print the screen.
.TP
.B Print Screen
Print the selection.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TERM
Defaults to
.BR st-256color ,
matching upstream st. The bundled
.B cupidterminal-256color
entry is also installed by
.BR "make install"
for customized builds.
.TP
.B WINDOWID
Set to the terminal's X11 window ID before the child process starts.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/local/share/terminfo
Default installation location for the terminal description.
.SH AUTHORS
See the LICENSE file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR stty (1),
.BR tic (1),
.BR xterm (1)
